  "body": "The current send dummy event mechanism will try and reduce the number of extremities in a room to below a threshold. However, if one of the extremities is really old then state res across a small number of extremities can still take quite a lot of resources. We should change the behaviour of the mechanism to try and remove old extremities, even if the count of extremities is below the threshold.",
